# Fixed 2026-11-26, defect 2856 (d-p260-mixedown), lane room-mixedown: the
# shape beside the macro, a `static inline` body of the header's calling
# the layer's function through the header's own declaration of it, while
# another group says `layer`: built at exit 0 until then, as the macro did.
extern "hero_time.h" layer
    function hero_time_wall_ns() -> i64

extern "fixedbugs-2856-a-layer-function-a-header-declares-otherwise-called-by-a-static-inline-body-is-told-at-the-binding.h"
    function stop_inline() -> i32  #~ ffi_layer_redeclared

function main()
    print(hero_time_wall_ns() > 0)
    print(stop_inline())
